.qdrant/
# Terminus runtime state: LangGraph checkpointer, task database, index
# manifest, and the local vector stores. All of it is derived from the working
# tree and is rebuildable, and some of it is large (the checkpointer grows with
# every conversation), so none of it belongs in version control.
.terminus/
